[
  {
    "begin_time": 4500,
    "end_time": 8140,
    "text": "吃完这碗安心长寿面，妈妈就一定能回心转意。",
    "speaker": "spk0"
  },
  {
    "begin_time": 12370,
    "end_time": 20250,
    "text": "十年了，公司不管，家庭不顾，难道你的丈夫和女儿还比不上一个全了腿的白月光吗？",
    "speaker": "spk2"
  },
  {
    "begin_time": 20690,
    "end_time": 24650,
    "text": "爸爸，快去给妈妈送过去，我去给妈妈准备礼物。",
    "speaker": "spk0"
  },
  {
    "begin_time": 25530,
    "end_time": 25850,
    "text": "好。",
    "speaker": "spk2"
  },
  {
    "begin_time": 41320,
    "end_time": 43280,
    "text": "老婆，注意身体啊！",
    "speaker": "spk2"
  },
  {
    "begin_time": 43440,
    "end_time": 44520,
    "text": "你需要多休息。",
    "speaker": "spk2"
  },
  {
    "begin_time": 45120,
    "end_time": 45800,
    "text": "滚出去！",
    "speaker": "spk3"
  },
  {
    "begin_time": 48080,
    "end_time": 49280,
    "text": "雪凡哥哥不想开门。",
    "speaker": "spk3"
  },
  {
    "begin_time": 49800,
    "end_time": 52080,
    "text": "陈暮雪，你能不能不要这么幼稚？",
    "speaker": "spk2"
  },
  {
    "begin_time": 52200,
    "end_time": 53800,
    "text": "难道你还想照顾他一辈子？",
    "speaker": "spk2"
  },
  {
    "begin_time": 54040,
    "end_time": 54520,
    "text": "谁呀？",
    "speaker": "spk4"
  },
  {
    "begin_time": 54720,
    "end_time": 58680,
    "text": "你别生气，都怪我不好，影响了你们的夫妻感情。",
    "speaker": "spk4"
  },
  {
    "begin_time": 59040,
    "end_time": 61080,
    "text": "要不，我还是搬出去吧。",
    "speaker": "spk4"
  },
  {
    "begin_time": 62150,
    "end_time": 62390,
    "text": "来。",
    "speaker": "spk4"
  },
  {
    "begin_time": 65590,
    "end_time": 67310,
    "text": "雪凡哥哥，你走什么走？",
    "speaker": "spk3"
  },
  {
    "begin_time": 67470,
    "end_time": 68790,
    "text": "要走也是他走！",
    "speaker": "spk3"
  },
  {
    "begin_time": 69230,
    "end_time": 69710,
    "text": "秦阳。",
    "speaker": "spk3"
  },
  {
    "begin_time": 69990,
    "end_time": 70870,
    "text": "给我滚出去！",
    "speaker": "spk1"
  },
  {
    "begin_time": 71630,
    "end_time": 72310,
    "text": "我滚！",
    "speaker": "spk5"
  },
  {
    "begin_time": 72910,
    "end_time": 74190,
    "text": "这是我的婚房！",
    "speaker": "spk5"
  },
  {
    "begin_time": 74710,
    "end_time": 80470,
    "text": "自从新婚夜开始，他就一直鸠占鹊巢，不知道的还以为他才是你的老公！",
    "speaker": "spk5"
  },
  {
    "begin_time": 80590,
    "end_time": 81310,
    "text": "够了，秦阳！",
    "speaker": "spk3"
  },
  {
    "begin_time": 82070,
    "end_time": 83270,
    "text": "你没有资格说他。",
    "speaker": "spk3"
  },
  {
    "begin_time": 84230,
    "end_time": 86030,
    "text": "你你说什么？",
    "speaker": "spk2"
  },
  {
    "begin_time": 86710,
    "end_time": 90510,
    "text": "我嫁你为妻，给你生女儿，这都只是意外。",
    "speaker": "spk3"
  },
  {
    "begin_time": 90790,
    "end_time": 93350,
    "text": "当初若不是因为你，雪白也不会变成这样。",
    "speaker": "spk3"
  },
  {
    "begin_time": 93790,
    "end_time": 95950,
    "text": "你最没有资格指责他。",
    "speaker": "spk3"
  },
  {
    "begin_time": 96910,
    "end_time": 98750,
    "text": "慕雪，你别这样。",
    "speaker": "spk4"
  },
  {
    "begin_time": 99310,
    "end_time": 102030,
    "text": "秦阳他毕竟是你老公，老公又怎么样？",
    "speaker": "spk3"
  },
  {
    "begin_time": 102430,
    "end_time": 104590,
    "text": "不过是字面上罢了。",
    "speaker": "spk3"
  },
  {
    "begin_time": 110670,
    "end_time": 111390,
    "text": "石木雪。",
    "speaker": "spk2"
  },
  {
    "begin_time": 111630,
    "end_time": 113110,
    "text": "你可知道“廉耻”二字？",
    "speaker": "spk5"
  },
  {
    "begin_time": 113310,
    "end_time": 115070,
    "text": "你这么做，对得起我跟悠悠吗？",
    "speaker": "spk5"
  },
  {
    "begin_time": 115230,
    "end_time": 115750,
    "text": "住口！",
    "speaker": "spk3"
  },
  {
    "begin_time": 116190,
    "end_time": 120510,
    "text": "亲娘，当年若不是你向我父母告状，我早把那个拖鞋品解决掉了！",
    "speaker": "spk3"
  },
  {
    "begin_time": 120950,
    "end_time": 122790,
    "text": "那可是你十月怀胎的女儿啊！",
    "speaker": "spk2"
  },
  {
    "begin_time": 123150,
    "end_time": 126110,
    "text": "女儿，她就不该来这世上！",
    "speaker": "spk3"
  },
  {
    "begin_time": 127350,
    "end_time": 131790,
    "text": "原来妈妈并不爱我，原来我是多余的。",
    "speaker": "spk6"
  },
  {
    "begin_time": 133090,
    "end_time": 133810,
    "text": "没关系。",
    "speaker": "spk6"
  },
  {
    "begin_time": 135540,
    "end_time": 139700,
    "text": "只要我将礼物送给妈妈，妈妈就一定会看到悠悠的好。",
    "speaker": "spk6"
  },
  {
    "begin_time": 140580,
    "end_time": 142620,
    "text": "嗯，木雪，你别这样说。",
    "speaker": "spk4"
  },
  {
    "begin_time": 143100,
    "end_time": 144460,
    "text": "毕竟他是你的亲生骨肉。",
    "speaker": "spk5"
  },
  {
    "begin_time": 144620,
    "end_time": 145300,
    "text": "闭嘴！",
    "speaker": "spk5"
  },
  {
    "begin_time": 146060,
    "end_time": 151100,
    "text": "你少在这里假惺惺的，都是因为你，你、你一直在破坏我的感情！",
    "speaker": "spk5"
  },
  {
    "begin_time": 151500,
    "end_time": 152060,
    "text": "闭嘴！",
    "speaker": "spk1"
  },
  {
    "begin_time": 153890,
    "end_time": 159010,
    "text": "青阳，当年若不是他从生化实验室里把我救出来，也不会瘸了腿。",
    "speaker": "spk3"
  },
  {
    "begin_time": 159530,
    "end_time": 164450,
    "text": "我照顾他是理所应当，我不允许你污蔑他，更不允许你伤害他。",
    "speaker": "spk3"
  },
  {
    "begin_time": 166630,
    "end_time": 167070,
    "text": "妈妈。",
    "speaker": "spk0"
  },
  {
    "begin_time": 167430,
    "end_time": 168350,
    "text": "你不要跟爸爸吵架！",
    "speaker": "spk3"
  },
  {
    "begin_time": 168430,
    "end_time": 168910,
    "text": "滚开！",
    "speaker": "spk3"
  },
  {
    "begin_time": 170750,
    "end_time": 171430,
    "text": "吃不许！",
    "speaker": "spk5"
  },
  {
    "begin_time": 172070,
    "end_time": 172470,
    "text": "悠悠！",
    "speaker": "spk5"
  },
  {
    "begin_time": 174430,
    "end_time": 175750,
    "text": "爸爸妈妈没吵架。",
    "speaker": "spk2"
  },
  {
    "begin_time": 176910,
    "end_time": 180110,
    "text": "妈妈，你别生爸爸的气好不好？",
    "speaker": "spk0"
  },
  {
    "begin_time": 180870,
    "end_time": 187670,
    "text": "悠悠带爸爸向妈妈道歉，这是悠悠送给妈妈的生日礼物，希望妈妈天天开心。",
    "speaker": "spk0"
  },
  {
    "begin_time": 193730,
    "end_time": 194690,
    "text": "媳妇，没事吧？",
    "speaker": "spk3"
  },
  {
    "begin_time": 194810,
    "end_time": 197450,
    "text": "妈妈，可以先看悠悠的礼物吗？",
    "speaker": "spk0"
  },
  {
    "begin_time": 197730,
    "end_time": 198250,
    "text": "走开！",
    "speaker": "spk3"
  },
  {
    "begin_time": 199530,
    "end_time": 200050,
    "text": "悠悠！",
    "speaker": "spk5"
  },
  {
    "begin_time": 201330,
    "end_time": 206090,
    "text": "悠悠送给妈妈的生日礼物，怎么可以？",
    "speaker": "spk7"
  },
  {
    "begin_time": 206850,
    "end_time": 208130,
    "text": "怎么可以？",
    "speaker": "spk7"
  },
  {
    "begin_time": 209090,
    "end_time": 209530,
    "text": "悠悠！",
    "speaker": "spk7"
  },
  {
    "begin_time": 210210,
    "end_time": 210690,
    "text": "悠悠！",
    "speaker": "spk7"
  }
